    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1610840/extras/f769cf54dcac2252f34f2719be1944af.avif?t=1726964270\" /></div><br><br>Virtuous Western is a strategy game located in the old west, where our protagonist must eliminate all enemies in the area using a limited amount of bullets, to recover your stolen horse.<br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Interesting and fun puzzles</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1610840/extras/400c25453d04f2cc2595cc2d86a477ca.poster.avif?t=1726964270\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1610840/extras/400c25453d04f2cc2595cc2d86a477ca.webm?t=1726964270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1610840/extras/400c25453d04f2cc2595cc2d86a477ca.mp4?t=1726964270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Different ways to beat each stage</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1610840/extras/1795467e5b22eff943c4ed9a165caa16.poster.avif?t=1726964270\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1610840/extras/1795467e5b22eff943c4ed9a165caa16.webm?t=1726964270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1610840/extras/1795467e5b22eff943c4ed9a165caa16.mp4?t=1726964270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Beautiful pixel art graphics</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1610840/extras/1e2a5cb4df69b63be299b489339d8706.poster.avif?t=1726964270\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1610840/extras/1e2a5cb4df69b63be299b489339d8706.webm?t=1726964270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1610840/extras/1e2a5cb4df69b63be299b489339d8706.mp4?t=1726964270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Different ways to eliminate enemies</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1610840/extras/a62d354efa3c56efdd7d3cf992bf845c.poster.avif?t=1726964270\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1610840/extras/a62d354efa3c56efdd7d3cf992bf845c.webm?t=1726964270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1610840/extras/a62d354efa3c56efdd7d3cf992bf845c.mp4?t=1726964270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>30 stages in the main campaign</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1610840/extras/e6153a5ef8f059f1c27ac6478ad0c8ed.poster.avif?t=1726964270\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1610840/extras/e6153a5ef8f059f1c27ac6478ad0c8ed.webm?t=1726964270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1610840/extras/e6153a5ef8f059f1c27ac6478ad0c8ed.mp4?t=1726964270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Speedrun mode with stopwatch</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/16108